# searchconsole-mcp — core context

Read-only **Google Search Console** MCP server. User docs: [README.md](../../README.md). Agents: topic rules under `.cursor/rules/` (apply by file path).

## Identity

- npm: `@vmandic/searchconsole-mcp` — CLI `searchconsole-mcp`
- Repo: https://github.com/vmandic/searchconsole-mcp
- Five tools: `gsc_*` + `gsc_mcp_server_ping`; scope `webmasters.readonly` only
- Stdio default; optional HTTP (loopback-first)

## Commands (repo root)

```bash
npm ci && npm test && npm run build:prod
node dist/server.js --help
```

